ol invoicing accepted</li>\\n        <li>Freight-rate shipping and drop-ship to event venues</li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <div class=\\\"bulk-cta\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"#quote-form\\\">Get My Free Quote</a>\\n        <div class=\\\"callbox\\\">Prefer to talk it through? Call <a href=\\\"tel:+18005551234\\\">1-800-555-1234</a><br><span style=\\\"font-size:13px\\\">Mon&ndash;Fri, 9am&ndash;5pm PT &mdash; no obligation, no pressure.</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"quotecard\\\" id=\\\"quote-form\\\">\\n      <h3>Request bulk pricing</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Takes about 30 seconds. A real person replies with your quote &mdash; typically within 1 business day.</p>\\n      <form action=\\\"/bulk-quote\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"bq-name\\\">Name</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"bq-name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"bq-org\\\">Studio / school / organization</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"bq-org\\\" name=\\\"organization\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. Riverbend Yoga Studio\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"bq-email\\\">Email</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"bq-email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"bq-phone\\\">Phone (optional &mdash; fastest way to quote)</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"bq-phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"(555) 555-5555\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"bq-type\\\">I&#39;m buying for</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"bq-type\\\" name=\\\"buyer_type\\\">\\n          <option>Yoga studio</option>\\n          <option>School / university</option>\\n          <option>Event, retreat or festival</option>\\n          <option>Gym, hotel or corporate wellness</option>\\n          <option>Reseller / wholesale</option>\\n        </select>\\n        <label for=\\\"bq-items\\\">What do you need? (items &amp; quantities)</label>\\n        <textarea id=\\\"bq-items\\\" name=\\\"items\\\" rows=\\\"3\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. 40 mats, 60 blocks, 30 straps\\\"></textarea>\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-alt\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My Free Quote</button>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:center\\\">No cost, no commitment. Or call <a href=\\\"tel:+18005551234\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#33573d\\\">1-800-555-1234</a>.</p>\\n      </form>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fgrid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Bulk &amp; Wholesale</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Studio pricing</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">School &amp; university orders</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Event &amp; retreat orders</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"tel:+