\"logo\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">Yoga<span>Direct</span></a>\\n    <nav aria-label=\\\"Main\\\">\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats/\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props/\\\">Props</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks/\\\">Blocks</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps/\\\">Straps</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters/\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\">Wholesale</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </nav>\\n    <div class=\\\"head-actions\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/search/\\\">Search</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/account/\\\">Account</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/cart/\\\">Cart (0)</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap hero-grid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h1>Yoga mats &amp; props built for real practice &mdash; at direct prices</h1>\\n      <p>We manufacture and source our own gear, so studios, events and home practitioners get high-quality mats, blocks, straps and bolsters without the markup.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-cta\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats/\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\">Get Wholesale Pricing</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"hero-img\\\">Yoga mats &amp; props collection</div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"trust\\\">\\n  <span>Supplying the yoga community since 1999</span>\\n  <span>Free shipping over $99</span>\\n  <span>30-day returns</span>\\n  <span>Bulk &amp; studio discounts</span>\\n  <span>Ships from our own warehouse</span>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Our best-selling mats and props, ready to ship today.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Deluxe Yoga Mat</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n          <h3>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$24.95 <small>$32.95</small></div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/deluxe-yoga-mat/\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Foam Yoga Block</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n          <h3>High-Density Foam Block</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$9.95</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/foam-yoga-block/\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Cotton Yoga Strap</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n          <h3>8' Cotton Yoga Strap</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/cotton-yoga-strap/\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Rectangular Bolster</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n          <h3>Rectangular Yoga Bolster</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$44.95</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-bolster/\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>Shop by need</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Whether you are outfitting a studio or starting your first practice.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"cats\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats/\\\"><h3>Yoga Mats</h3><p>Thicknesses from 1/8\\\" travel mats to 1/2\\\" extra-cushion mats.</p></a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-props/\\\"><h3>Props &amp; Accessories</h3><p>Blocks, straps, bolsters, blankets, wheels and cleaning supplies.</p></a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\"><h3>Studio &amp; Wholesale</h3><p>Volume pricing on bulk mats and props for studios and events.</p></a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>About YogaDirect</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"section faq HDLmClass4d895367\\\" id=\\\"faq\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-heading\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap faq-grid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h2 id=\\\"faq-heading\\\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Quick answers on shipping, returns, choosing a mat and wholesale pricing.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-help\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Still have a question?</h3>\\n        <p>Our yoga-loving team is happy to help you pick the right gear or quote a bulk order.</p>\\n        <p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/contact-us/\\\">Contact Us</a></p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <details open>\\n        <summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"answer\\\">In-stock orders placed by 1pm ET on a business day ship the same day from our own warehouse; other orders ship within 1&ndash;2 business days. Standard ground delivery typically arrives in 2&ndash;5 business days, and expedited options are shown at checkout with the estimated delivery date before you pay.</div>\\n      </details>\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Do you offer free shipping?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"answer\\\">Yes &mdash; standard shipping is free on orders over $99 shipped within the contiguous United States. Your cart shows exactly how much more you need to add to qualify, and oversized or freight items (such as bulk mat cases) display any additional charges up front.</div>\\n      </details>\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>What is your return policy?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"answer\\\">You can return unused items in their original condition within 30 days of delivery for a refund of the product price. Start your return from your account or <a href=\\\"/contact-us/\\\">contact us</a> and we will send instructions. If anything arrives damaged or defective, we will replace it and cover the shipping.</div>\\n      </details>\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Which mat thickness should I choose?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"answer\\\">1/8\\\" (3mm) mats are light, packable and best for travel and balance-focused flow. 1/4\\\" (6mm) is our most popular all-purpose thickness, balancing cushion with stability. 1/2\\\" (12mm) mats give maximum joint cushioning for restorative, therapeutic or knee-sensitive practice. Studios usually order 1/4\\\" for class use and a few 1/2\\\" mats for props and support.</div>\\n      </details>\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Can I get wholesale or bulk pricing?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"answer\\\">Absolutely. Because we manufacture and source our own goods, we offer tiered wholesale pricing for studios, schools, gyms, hotels and events &mdash; discounts typically begin at case quantities. Apply on our <a href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\">wholesale page</a> and we will send a quote, usually within one business day.</div>\\n      </details>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass4d895367\\\">\\n{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How fast will my order ship?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"In-stock orders placed by 1pm ET on a business day ship the same day; other orders ship within 1-2 business days. Standard ground delivery typically arrives in 2-5 business days, with expedited options at checkout.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do you offer free shipping?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Standard shipping is free on orders over $99 within the contiguous United States. Oversized or freight items show any additional charges up front.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is your return policy?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Unused items in original condition may be returned within 30 days of delivery for a refund of the product price. Damaged or defective items are replaced with shipping covered.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which mat thickness should I choose?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"1/8 inch (3mm) mats suit travel and balance work, 1/4 inch (6mm) is the popular all-purpose thickness, and 1/2 inch (12mm) gives maximum cushioning for restorative or knee-sensitive practice.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I get wholesale or bulk pricing?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Tiered wholesale pricing is available for studios, schools, gyms, hotels and events, typically starting at case quantities. Apply on the wholesale page for a quote within about one business day.\\\"}}]}\\n</script>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"newsletter\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Get yoga deals in your inbox</h2>\\n    <p style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Join our list for new arrivals, restocks and subscriber-only savings.</p>\\n    <form action=\\\"/subscribe/\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <l