ns{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}\\n  .search{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;min-width:200px;}\\n  .btn{display:inline-block;border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 26px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;}\\n  .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;}\\n  .btn-primary:hover{background:#c95c2b;}\\n  .btn-secondary{background:#fff;color:var(--brand-dark);border:2px solid var(--brand-dark);}\\n  .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:32px;align-items:center;padding:44px 0;}\\n  .hero h1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;}\\n  .hero p.sub{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 22px;}\\n  .hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\\n  .hero-trust{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);}\\n  .trust-strip{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f9f7;}\\n  .trust-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;padding:20px 0;text-align:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;}\\n  section{padding:44px 0;}\\n  h2.section-title{font-size:30px;margin:0 0 8px;}\\n  p.section-sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 26px;}\\n  .products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;}\\n  .card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}\\n  .card .thumb{background:#eef1ee;aspect-ratio:1/1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#9aa49b;font-size:14px;}\\n  .card-body{padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;flex:1;}\\n  .card h3{font-size:16px;margin:0;}\\n  .stars{color:#f0a500;font-size:14px;}\\n  .price{font-weight:800;font-size:18px;}\\n  .price s{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;font-size:14px;margin-left:6px;}\\n  .card .btn{margin-top:auto;padding:11px 16px;font-size:15px;}\\n  .cats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;}\\n  .cat{border-radius:12px;background:#f4f6f3;padding:26px;text-decoration:none;}\\n  .cat h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:19px;}\\n  .cat span{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;}\\n  .about{background:#f8f9f7;}\\n  .about-inner{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;}\\n  .reviews{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;}\\n  .review{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;font-size:15px;}\\n  .review .who{margin-top:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;}\\n  .email-capture{background:var(--brand-dark);color:#fff;}\\n  .email-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:center;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;}\\n  .email-inner h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;}\\n  .email-form{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\\n  .email-form input{flex:1 1 220px;border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;font-size:16px;}\\n  footer.site{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px 0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);}\\n  .foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:24px;}\\n  .foot-grid a{display:block;text-decoration:none;padding:3px 0;}\\n\\n  /* Mobile sticky CTA bar */\\n  .sticky-cta{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:900;display:none;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 -6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:10px 12px;padding-bottom:calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));}\\n  .sticky-cta .sticky-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}\\n  .sticky-cta .sticky-offer{font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;flex:1;}\\n  .sticky-cta .sticky-offer strong{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--brand-dark);}\\n  .sticky-cta .btn{padding:12px 18px;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;}\\n\\n  /* Responsive rules for all sections */\\n  @media (max-width:1024px){\\n    .products{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}\\n    .trust-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);font-size:13px;}\\n    .hero h1{font-size:38px;}\\n    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}\\n  }\\n  @media (max-width:820px){\\n    .header-inner{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;}\\n    nav.main{order:3;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;font-size:14px;gap:10px;}\\n    .header-actions{margin-left:auto;}\\n    .search{min-width:0;width:150px;}\\n    .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:28px 0;text-align:left;}\\n    .hero h1{font-size:32px;}\\n    .hero p.sub{font-size:17px;}\\n    .cats,.reviews,.email-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n    .products{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;}\\n    .trust-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}\\n    section{padding:32px 0;}\\n    h2.section-title{font-size:24px;}\\n  }\\n  @media (max-width:600px){\\n    .sticky-cta{display:block;}\\n    body{padding-bottom:76px;} /* room for sticky bar */\\n    header.site{position:static;}\\n    .hero-ctas .btn{width:100%;}\\n    .hero-trust{gap:12px;font-size:13px;}\\n    .products{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;}\\n    .card-body{padding:10px;}\\n    .card h3{font-size:15px;}\\n    .promo-bar{font-size:13px;}\\n    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n    .email-form input{flex:1 1 100%;}\\n    .email-form .btn{width:100%;}\\n  }\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"promo-bar\\\">Save <strong>15% off</strong> your first order with code <strong>WELCOME15</strong> &nbsp;+&nbsp; <strong>Free shipping on orders $75+</strong></div>\\n\\n<header class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"header-inner\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"logo\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">YogaDirect</a>\\n    <nav class=\\\"main\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Props</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/bolsters-cushions\\\">Bolsters</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio &amp; Bulk</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a>\\n    </nav>\\n    <div class=\\\"header-actions\\\">\\n      <input class=\\\"search\\\" type=\\\"search\\\" placeholder=\\\"Search mats, blocks, straps…\\\" aria-label=\\\"Search products\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/cart\\\" aria-label=\\\"Cart\\\">Cart (0)</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<main>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Yoga mats &amp; props, direct from the maker since 1999</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Studio-quality gear at wholesale-friendly prices. Save 15% on your first order with code <strong>WELCOME15</strong> — plus free shipping over $75.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"hero-ctas\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio &amp; Bulk Pricing</a>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"hero-trust\\\">\\n          <span>★★★★★ 12,000+ reviews</span>\\n          <span>Ships in 1 business day</span>\\n          <span>30-day easy returns</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"thumb\\\" style=\\\"background:#eef1ee;border-radius:14px;min-height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#9aa49b;\\\">Yoga mats &amp; props</div>\\n    </section>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"trust-strip\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"trust-grid\\\">\\n        <div>Free shipping $75+</div>\\n        <div>Direct manufacturer pricing</div>\\n        <div>Trusted by 5,000+ studios</div>\\n        <div>Serving yogis since 1999</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section id=\\\"featured\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Our best-selling mats and props — in stock and ready to ship today.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"products\\\">\\n        <article class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Deluxe Yoga Mat</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n            <h3>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★ <span style=\\\"color:#5d666e\\\">(2,418)</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\">$24.95 <s>$32.95</s></div>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/deluxe-yoga-mat\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </article>\\n        <article class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Foam Yoga Block</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n            <h3>High-Density Foam Block</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★ <span style=\\\"color:#5d666e\\\">(1,902)</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.95</div>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/foam-yoga-block\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </article>\\n        <article class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Cotton Yoga Strap</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n            <h3>8ft Cotton Yoga Strap</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★☆ <span style=\\\"color:#5d666e\\\">(1,146)</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/cotton-yoga-strap\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </article>\\n        <article class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Rectangular Bolster</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n            <h3>Restorative Bolster</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★ <span style=\\\"color:#5d666e\\\">(863)</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\">$44.95 <s>$54.95</s></div>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-bolster\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </article>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Shop by category</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Everything you need for your studio, event, or home practice.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"cats\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\"><h3>Yoga Mats</h3><span>Sticky, eco, extra-thick &amp; travel mats</span></a>\\n        <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\"><h3>Blocks, Straps &amp; Props</h3><span>Support for every level of practice</span></a>\\n        <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\"><h3>Studio &amp; Bulk Packs</h3><span>Volume pricing for studios &amp; events</span></a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"about\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"about-inner\\\">\\n        <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Why shop YogaDirect</h2>\\n        <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n        <p><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Best Sellers</a></p>\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section>\\n      <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">What customers say</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"reviews\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>Great mats at a price that let us outfit the whole studio. Shipping was fast.</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">Megan R. — Studio Owner</div></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>Ordered blocks and straps for a retreat. Quality matched brands costing twice as much.</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">David L. — Retreat Host</div></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>My go-to for home practice gear for years. Never had a bad order.</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">Priya S. — Home Practitioner</div></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"email-capture\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"email-inner\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h2>Get 15% off your first order</h2>\\n          <p>Join our list for exclusive deals, new arrivals, and studio pricing updates.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <form class=\\\"email-form\\\" action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px;\\\">Email address</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required>\\n          <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My 15% Off</button>\\n        </form>\\n      </section>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</main>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"foot-grid\\\">\\n      <div><strong>Shop</strong><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Props</a><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></div>\\n      <div><strong>Wholesale</strong><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio Packs</a><a href=\\\"/bulk-quote\\\">Request a Quote</a></div>\\n      <div><strong>Help</strong><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping</a><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></div>\\n      <div><strong>About</strong><a href=\\\"/about\\\">Our Story</a><a href=\\\"/reviews\\\">Reviews</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <p>&copy; 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<!-- Mobile sticky bottom CTA bar -->\\n<div class=\\\"sticky-cta HDLmClasse42966be\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-label=\\\"Current offer and shop now\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sticky-inner\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"sticky-offer\\\">\\n      <strong>15% off + free shipping $75+</strong>\\n      Code WELCOME15\\n    </div>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added a mobile sticky bottom CTA bar restating the offer.\",\"Why\":\"Keeps the offer and buy action visible on small screens, raising conversions.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClasse42966be\"},{\"What\":\"Added responsive layout rules for all new sections.\",\"Why\":\"Prevents broken layouts on phones and tablets, reducing bounce.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass431387ea\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"The fetch only returned plain text, so I need to construct the HTML from scratch. I'm rebuilding the full page with the original content like the featured products section and about paragraph, then adding a sticky mobile CTA bar at the bottom that repeats the offer along with responsive layout rules for everything.\n\nNow I'm computing DJB2 hashes for the two improvements: the sticky CTA bar and the responsive layout rules. I'll use concise descriptions for each improvement and calculate the hash values by iterating through each character with the formula hash = (hash * 33 + char code) mod 2^32. Computing character codes... Computing the hash values through each character with modulo arithmetic to handle overflow at 2^32. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: 'o' produces 1361490804 after modular arithmetic, 'b' yields 1979523670, and 'i' gives 899 before the final step. Continuing through the hash computation for characters s, t, and i, applying the modular arithmetic operations and tracking the running values through each iteration. Continuing the hash calculations through characters b, o, and into t, applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications by 33 and 32, then subtracting multiples of 4294967296 to keep values in range. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters, working through the modular arithmetic to keep values in range. Continuing the hash computation through characters 37-40, tracking the modular arithmetic as each character gets processed and the running value gets multiplied, reduced, and incremented. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: n produces 2826958259, g gives 3095309434, space yields 3360963546, and t starts at 3360963546 with the calculation in progress. Continuing through positions 53-55, computing hash values for the remaining characters by applying the multiplication and modulo operations, tracking the intermediate results as each character gets processed. 4188853707. Continuing through characters 'e', 'p', 's', and space, applying the same multiplication and modulo operations to track the hash values through each step. Continuing the hash computation through characters 'o', 'f', and 'f', applying the multiplication and modulo operations at each step to track the running value. Continuing through character 75 with 'n', I'm tracking the modular arithmetic where the value exceeds 2^32 and requires subtracting the modulus multiple times to get the correct remainder. For character 76 'd', the calculation yields 3477161529, and I'm starting on character 77 with the space character. Continuing the hash computation through characters 'a', 'c', 't', and 'i', applying the same multiplication and modulo operations to track the running value. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: v, i, s, i, and b, applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications and subtractions to track the rolling hash value. Continuing with character 98, I'm processing 'n' and working through the modular arithmetic: multiplying by 33, then by 32, adding the previous result, and subtracting multiples of the base value to get the remainder before adding the character code. Moving through characters 99 and 100 with 'space' and the start of 's', following the same pattern of hash computation and character encoding. Continuing through the hash computation for each character: processing the 'l', space, 's', 'c', and starting on 'r', applying the same modular arithmetic pattern at each step. Continuing through the hash computation for each character, working through the modular arithmetic and accumulating values for the space, r, a, and i characters. Continuing the hash computation through the remaining characters of the string, processing each letter with the rolling hash algorithm and accumulating the results. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: s produces 3474912887, i gives 3002975680, o yields 313949743, and I'm working through n now, recalculating to verify the multiplication. Converting to hexadecimal by repeatedly dividing by powers of 16, working through each digit position to get 0xE42966...\n\nNow I'm looking at the second improvement, which is about adding responsive layout rules that prevent broken layouts on mobile devices.\n\nI'm computing the hash for this string by reusing the calculation from the first improvement since both start with \"Added\". After processing the first five characters, I get the same intermediate hash value of 214943127. Then continuing through the space and into \"responsive layout rules for all new sections,\" I'm working through each character step by step, multiplying by 33 and adding the character code to build up the final hash. Continuing through characters 13-16, computing the rolling hash values with modular arithmetic for each letter in the sequence. Continuing the hash computation through characters 'o', 'u', 't', and space, applying the same multiplication and modulo operations to track the running value. Continuing through the hash computation for each character, working through the modular arithmetic to keep values bounded. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: l produces 2747038114, another l gives 457944654, space yields 2227271726, and I'm partway through processing n. Continuing through the character hash calculations for the remaining letters, working through the modular arithmetic for each step. Continuing the hash computation for the phrase \"Prevents broken layouts on phones and tablets, reducing bounce.\" through characters P, r, e, and into v, applying the same multiplicative and modular operations at each step. Continuing through characters 60-63, computing hash values with modular arithmetic for space, b, r, and o. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters in the string, processing each one through the same multiplication and modulo operations to advance the rolling hash value. Continuing the calculation through character 77, where I'm processing 'n' and getting a result that's converging toward a specific value. Continuing through characters 'n', 'e', 's', and another space, applying the same multiplicative hash transformation with successive modulo operations to build up the running value. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: space, t, a, b, and l, applying the same multiplication and modulo operations at each step. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters—space, r, e, and d—applying the same modular arithmetic operations with successive multiplications and subtractions to track the rolling hash value. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: n produces 1188725145, g gives 573224224, space yields 1736530240, b results in 1470923170, and o is partway through calculation. Continuing through the character iterations, processing 'e', then the period character, which gives me h2 = 1125353450. Now I'm converting this to hexadecimal and breaking down the remainder to find the next component.\n\nNow I'm building the HTML page for the e-commerce site, creating a complete homepage with the fetched content integrated alongside header navigation, featured products, and a responsive mobile CTA bar.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"The fetch only returned plain text, so I need to construct the HTML from scratch. I'm rebuilding the full page with the original content like the featured products section and about paragraph, then adding a sticky mobile CTA bar at the bottom that repeats the offer along with responsive layout rules for everything.\n\nNow I'm computing DJB2 hashes for the two improvements: the sticky CTA bar and the responsive layout rules. I'll use concise descriptions for each improvement and calculate the hash values by iterating through each character with the formula hash = (hash * 33 + char code) mod 2^32. Computing character codes... Computing the hash values through each character with modulo arithmetic to handle overflow at 2^32. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: 'o' produces 1361490804 after modular arithmetic, 'b' yields 1979523670, and 'i' gives 899 before the final step. Continuing through the hash computation for characters s, t, and i, applying the modular arithmetic operations and tracking the running values through each iteration. Continuing the hash calculations through characters b, o, and into t, applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications by 33 and 32, then subtracting multiples of 4294967296 to keep values in range. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters, working through the modular arithmetic to keep values in range. Continuing the hash computation through characters 37-40, tracking the modular arithmetic as each character gets processed and the running value gets multiplied, reduced, and incremented. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: n produces 2826958259, g gives 3095309434, space yields 3360963546, and t starts at 3360963546 with the calculation in progress. Continuing through positions 53-55, computing hash values for the remaining characters by applyi