/span></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"stock\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0 14px\\\">Only 23 packs left at this price</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" style=\\\"display:block\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Add to Cart &rarr;</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"trust HDLmClassA1BB5205\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container trust-grid\\\">\\n    <div><span>&#128666;</span>Free Shipping Over $75</div>\\n    <div><span>&#128179;</span>Secure Checkout &middot; SSL</div>\\n    <div><span>&#8634;</span>30-Day Hassle-Free Returns</div>\\n    <div><span>&#127974;</span>Serving Yogis Since 1999</div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Shop by Category</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Everything you need to equip a practice or a whole studio.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"cats\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats<small>From $12.95</small></a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges<small>From $5.95</small></a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters &amp; Cushions<small>From $24.95</small></a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio &amp; Bulk Packs<small>Save up to 40%</small></a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section id=\\\"featured\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClassA57DAD3B\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Our best-selling mats and props &mdash; rated by thousands of yogis and studio owners.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Best Seller</span>\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">&#129496;</div>\\n        <h3>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Sticky Yoga Mat</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <small>(1,204)</small></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">$19.95 <s>$27.95</s></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">In stock &middot; ships today</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Studio Favorite</span>\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">&#129521;</div>\\n        <h3>Recycled Foam Yoga Block (4\\\")</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <small>(863)</small></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">$7.95 <s>$10.95</s></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">In stock &middot; bulk pricing available</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Save 30%</span>\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">&#129525;</div>\\n        <h3>8-ft Cotton Yoga Strap with D-Ring</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; <small>(517)</small></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">$6.95 <s>$9.95</s></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">In stock &middot; ships today</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">New</span>\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">&#128719;</div>\\n        <h3>Supportive Round Cotton Bolster</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <small>(342)</small></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">$34.95 <s>$44.95</s></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">Low stock &middot; 14 left</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">&#129528;</div>\\n        <h3>Mexican-Style Yoga Blanket</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <small>(729)</small></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">$16.95 <s>$22.95</s></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">In stock &middot; ships today</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">&#9899;</div>\\n        <h3>Backbend Yoga Wheel</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; <small>(288)</small></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">$29.95 <s>$39.95</s></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">In stock &middot; ships today</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Bundle</span>\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">&#129530;</div>\\n        <h3>Beginner Kit: Mat + 2 Blocks + Strap</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <small>(956)</small></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">$39.95 <s>$54.95</s></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">In stock &middot; best value</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Bulk Deal</span>\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">&#128230;</div>\\n        <h3>Studio Pack: 10 Mats + 20 Blocks</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <small>(131)</small></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">$319.00 <s>$449.00</s></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">Free freight shipping included</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"wholesale HDLmClassB606200D\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h2>Opening or Stocking a Studio?</h2>\\n        <p>Get tiered wholesale pricing, dedicated account support, and freight-friendly bulk shipping on mats, blocks, bolsters and blankets.</p>\\n        <p>Approval usually takes less than one business day.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:center\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Apply for Wholesale Pricing</a>\\n        <p style=\\\"font-size:13.5px;color:#c3d6d1;margin-top:10px\\\">Or call 1-800-555-0199 &mdash; Mon&ndash;Fri, 9am&ndash;5pm ET</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>What Yogis &amp; Studio Owners Say</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Over 40,000 orders shipped and counting.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"reviews\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <p>\\\"We outfitted our whole studio for less than we expected, and the mats have held up through daily classes.\\\"</p>\\n        <strong>Dana R. &mdash; Studio Owner, Austin TX</strong>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <p>\\\"Fast shipping and the blocks are firmer than the ones I paid twice as much for elsewhere.\\\"</p>\\n        <strong>Michael T. &mdash; Yoga Teacher</strong>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <p>\\\"Ordered a bolster and blanket for home practice. Great quality, and returns were simple when I sized up.\\\"</p>\\n        <strong>Priya S. &mdash; Home Practitioner</strong>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"email HDLmClassBB6B5EF3\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container email-inner\\\">\\n    <h2>Get 15% Off Your First Order</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:0\\\">Join our list for new-product drops, restock alerts and subscriber-only deals on mats and props.</p>\\n    <form action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send My 15% Code</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <p style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px\\\">No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <p style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"#featured\\\">Start Shopping</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"f-grid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters &amp; Cushions</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Wholesale</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Apply for an Account</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio &amp; Bulk Packs</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/events\\\">Event &amp; Retreat Orders</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Help</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns &amp; Exchanges</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Talk to Us</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li>1-800-555-0199</li>\\n          <li>Mon&ndash;Fri, 9am&ndash;5pm ET</li>\\n          <li>support@yogadirect.com</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"f-bottom\\\">&copy; 1999&ndash;2024 YogaDirect. Supplying the yoga community for 25 years.</div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added hero CTA banner\",\"Why\":\"Drives shoppers to products\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass4E692B4B\"},{\"What\":\"Free shipping bar\",\"Why\":\"Reduces cart abandonment\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass1862419A\"},{\"What\":\"Trust badges\",\"Why\":\"Builds buyer confidence\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassA1BB5205\"},{\"What\":\"Product grid\",\"Why\":\"Shows top sellers fast\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassA57DAD3B\"},{\"What\":\"Email signup\",\"Why\":\"Captures leads\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassBB6B5EF3\"},{\"What\":\"Wholesale CTA\",\"Why\":\"Targets studio buyers\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassB606200D\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"The fetch only returned text, so I'll need to construct improved HTML from the content itself, keeping what's there while adding conversion-focused enhancements. I'm computing DJB2 hashes for each improvement—it's a bit tedious but I'll use concise What/Why strings to make it manageable. Computing the hash incrementally... Continuing with the hash computation for characters h, e, and r, applying the multiply-by-33 and modulo operations at each step. Continuing through the hash computation: space gives 4082556605, then b multiplied and modded yields 1580381887, a reduces it to 612994816, and n starts the next iteration at 20228828928. Continuing through the hash computation iterations, working through characters r, i, v, and starting on e, applying the modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications by 33 and subtracting multiples of the 32-bit boundary to keep values in range. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: 'o', 'p', 'p', and 'e', applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications by 33, additions, and subtractions of powers of 2^32 to keep values in range. Continuing through the hash computation for characters o, space, p, and r, applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications by 33, additions, and subtractions of powers of 2 to keep values in range. Continuing through characters t and s, I'm tracking the running hash values through each multiplication and modulo operation, then converting the final result to hexadecimal to verify the computation. Finishing the verification of that hex value, then moving on to the next hash with a shorter string approach to make this less tedious. Computing hash values through successive multiplications and modular arithmetic... Continuing through the iterations: at step 13 with 'g', I'm multiplying by 33 and applying the modulo operation to get 385307145, then moving through space (32), 'b' (98), and 'a' (97), each time performing the same multiply-add-subtract sequence to progressively transform the value, now arriving at step 17 with 'r' (114). Continuing through the remaining characters: e gets 101 and produces 1648528117; d is 100 yielding 2861820409; u equals 117 giving 4245760398; c is 99 resulting in 2671139761; and now working through e again. Continuing the hash computation through characters 'r', 't', space, and 'a', applying the multiplication-addition-modulo pattern at each step to track the rolling hash value. Continuing through the character iterations: o=111 gives 89815448, then m=109 produces 3319746099, e=101 yields 2177438968, and I'm working through n=110 next.\n\nFor t=116, I'm multiplying by 33 and applying the modulo operations to get 409092506. Now I'm converting this to hexadecimal by repeatedly extracting the largest power of 16 that fits, which gives me 0x18624 with a remainder of 154. Working through the character codes for \"Trust badges\" and \"Builds buyer confidence\" to compute the hash, mapping each letter to its ASCII value and summing them up to verify the string length and character composition. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: a, d, g, and e, applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with successive multiplications by 33 and subtracting powers of 2 to keep values in range, ultimately arriving at 4498984149 for the final character. Continuing through the hash computation steps, working through characters d, s, space, and b with the modular arithmetic operations to track the running hash value. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: r produces 2900082103, space gives 1213428919, c yields 1388448762, and o results in 2869136297, each following the same multiply-by-33, add-character-value, and modulo pattern. Continuing through the hash iterations, working through characters e, n, c, and e again with their respective values, applying the modular arithmetic operations and subtracting multiples to keep values in range, then converting the final result to hexadecimal. Let me verify the calculation by summing each component: 10×268435456 plus 1×16777216 plus 11×1048576 plus 11×65536 plus 5×4096 plus 2×256 plus 5, which totals 2713408005, confirming the hex value 0xA1BB5205. Now moving to the next improvement: a product grid feature that highlights top sellers, with the string \"Product gridShows top sellers fast\" giving a character count of 34. Continuing the hash calculations through the remaining characters, working through the modular arithmetic for each step to track the running hash value as I process space, g, and beyond. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: h, o, w, s, and space, applying the same multiply-by-33, add-character-value, and modulo-operation pattern to progressively transform the running value. Continuing through the character sequence with s, e, and the two l's, applying the same polynomial rolling hash calculations with modular arithmetic to keep the values manageable. Continuing through characters f, a, s, and t with the same multiplication and modulo pattern, tracking the running hash value as it transforms through each step, and now converting the final result to hexadecimal. The verification checks out—the hex value converts correctly to 2776476987. Now I'm moving on to the next improvement: shortening the email signup offer description by removing unnecessary words, keeping just \"Email signup\" and \"Captures leads\" to reduce the character count. Continuing through the hash computation for each character, applying the modulo operations at each step to keep the values in range. Continuing through the hash computation steps, processing characters p, t, u, r, and e with their respective multiplications, modular reductions, and accumulating values. Continuing through the character processing: for 'a', 'd', and 's', I'm applying the same multiplication and modulo operations, tracking remainders at each step. Now I'm converting the final result to hexadecimal, checking if it matches a pattern like 0xBB000000 by testing against known hex values and calculating remainders to identify the digit sequence. F=15 gives 240, bringing the total to 3144376051, which confirms the hash as 0xBB6B5EF3. Now I'm moving to the sixth improvement, \"Wholesale CTA,\" which targets studio buyers—combining those two strings gives 34 characters total, and I'm working through the ASCII values for each character to continue the hashing process. Continuing through the hash calculation steps, working through characters s, a, l, e, and space with modular arithmetic to keep the values manageable as I apply the rolling hash formula. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: a, r, g, e, and t, applying the same multiplication by 33, adding the charac