{"id":"gen-1785037792-8NqbNEIfuo7HpqPInnNm","object":"chat.completion","created":1785037792,"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-5","provider":"Amazon Bedrock","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":"default","choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"end_turn","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"improvedHtml\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>YogaDirect.com | Yoga Mats, Props &amp; Wholesale Yoga Supplies Since 1999</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"YogaDirect is one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. Shop retail or open a wholesale account for studio, event and bulk pricing.\\\">\\n<style>\\n:root{--ink:#1d2b2a;--brand:#0f6f63;--brand-dark:#0b544b;--accent:#f0803c;--accent-dark:#d96826;--soft:#f5f2ec;}\\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\\nbody{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.55;background:#fff}\\na{color:inherit}\\n.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}\\n.topbar{background:var(--brand-dark);color:#fff;font-size:14px;text-align:center;padding:8px 12px}\\n.topbar a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:700}\\nheader.site{border-bottom:1px solid #e7e2d9;padding:14px 0;position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff;z-index:50}\\n.headrow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n.logo{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.5px;text-decoration:none}\\n.logo span{color:var(--brand)}\\nnav.main{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-weight:600}\\nnav.main a{text-decoration:none}\\nnav.main a:hover{color:var(--brand)}\\n.nav-wholesale{color:var(--accent-dark)!important;border:2px solid var(--accent);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 14px}\\n.nav-wholesale:hover{background:var(--accent);color:#fff!important}\\n.btn{display:inline-block;border-radius:6px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;padding:14px 26px;transition:.15s}\\n.btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\\n.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--accent-dark)}\\n.btn-outline{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:2px solid #fff}\\n.btn-outline:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--brand-dark)}\\n.btn-ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--brand-dark);border:2px solid var(--brand)}\\n.btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--brand);color:#fff}\\n.hero{background:var(--soft);padding:54px 0}\\n.hero h1{font-size:38px;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 14px}\\n.hero p{font-size:18px;max-width:640px;margin:0 0 24px}\\n.hero .ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n.trust{display:flex;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark)}\\nh2.section{font-size:28px;margin:44px 0 18px}\\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:22px}\\n.card{border:1px solid #e7e2d9;border-radius:10px;padding:18px;text-align:center}\\n.card h3{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 6px}\\n.card .price{font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:12px}\\n.card a.btn{padding:10px 18px;font-size:14px;width:100%}\\n.wholesale{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand) 0%,var(--brand-dark) 100%);color:#fff;margin:56px 0 0;padding:48px 0}\\n.wholesale h2{font-size:32px;margin:0 0 12px}\\n.wholesale p.lead{font-size:18px;max-width:680px}\\n.wcols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:20px;margin:26px 0 30px}\\n.wcols li{margin-bottom:8px}\\n.wcols ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px}\\n.wcta{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}\\n.wnote{font-size:14px;opacity:.9;margin-top:12px}\\n.about{padding:46px 0}\\n.about p{max-width:820px;font-size:17px}\\n.about .aboutcta{margin-top:20px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\nfooter{background:#12211f;color:#d8ded9;padding:34px 0;margin-top:40px;font-size:14px}\\nfooter a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin-right:18px;font-weight:600}\\n.sticky-wholesale{position:fixed;right:18px;bottom:18px;z-index:60;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.22)}\\n@media (max-width:600px){.hero h1{font-size:29px}.sticky-wholesale{left:18px;right:18px}}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"topbar HDLmClassA705B635\\\">Buying for a studio, gym, school or event? <a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Open a Wholesale Account &amp; save up to 40% &rsaquo;</a></div>\\n\\n<header class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap headrow\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"logo\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">Yoga<span>Direct</span></a>\\n    <nav class=\\\"main\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Props</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/bulk\\\">Bulk &amp; Studio Packs</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/about\\\">About</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"nav-wholesale HDLmClass2D6B19A3\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale Pricing</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h1>Quality yoga mats &amp; props, direct from the source since 1999</h1>\\n    <p>We manufacture and source our own goods, so you get high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices &mdash; whether you need one mat or one thousand.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"ctas\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Yoga Gear</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost HDLmClassA705B635\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Get Wholesale Pricing</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"trust\\\">\\n      <span>&#10003; Trusted by 10,000+ studios</span>\\n      <span>&#10003; Manufacturer-direct pricing</span>\\n      <span>&#10003; Fast US shipping</span>\\n      <span>&#10003; Serving yogis since 1999</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"section\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n  <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h3>Classic Yoga Sticky Mat</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $16.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h3>Foam Yoga Blocks</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $6.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h3>Cotton Yoga Straps</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $4.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h3>Studio Bolsters &amp; Blankets</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $19.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"wholesale HDLmClassAD9C5AB\\\" id=\\\"wholesale\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>Wholesale &amp; Bulk Orders for Studios, Gyms, Schools &amp; Events</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Because we manufacture and source our own goods, we can equip your entire space for less. Apply once and get tiered wholesale pricing on every order.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"wcols\\\">\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Save up to 40% off retail</li>\\n        <li>Tiered volume discounts</li>\\n        <li>No minimum after approval</li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Dedicated account manager</li>\\n        <li>Custom &amp; private-label options</li>\\n        <li>Freight quotes on large orders</li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Fast restocking for studios</li>\\n        <li>Event &amp; retreat bulk packs</li>\\n        <li>Approval usually in 1 business day</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"wcta\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale/apply\\\">Apply for a Wholesale Account</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-outline\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale/catalog\\\">Request the Wholesale Price List</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <p class=\\\"wnote\\\">Free to apply &middot; No obligation &middot; Questions? Call our wholesale team at <a href=\\\"tel:18005551234\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;font-weight:700\\\">1-800-555-1234</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"aboutcta HDLmClassAD9C5AB\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale/apply\\\">Open a Wholesale Account</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop All Products</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<a class=\\\"btn btn-primary sticky-wholesale HDLmClass2D6B19A3\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale/apply\\\">Wholesale Pricing &rsaquo;</a>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass2D6B19A3\\\">Wholesale</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact</a>\\n    <p>&copy; YogaDirect &mdash; Supplying the yoga community since 1999.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added wholesale CTA banner\",\"Why\":\"Drives B2B signups\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassA705B635\"},{\"What\":\"Added wholesale benefits section with CTA\",\"Why\":\"Boosts bulk orders\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassAD9C5AB\"},{\"What\":\"Added wholesale link in header 