o our team for studio orders and bulk quotes.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sec\\\">What Our Customers Say</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sec-sub\\\">Rated 4.8 out of 5 by more than 12,000 verified customers.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"reviews\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <p>Ordered 20 mats for my studio and the quality and price were unbeatable. Shipping was fast, too.</p>\\n        <cite>Dana R.</cite><span class=\\\"verified\\\">&#10003; Verified Buyer</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <p>I have bought props here for years. Consistent quality and always great customer service.</p>\\n        <cite>Michael T.</cite><span class=\\\"verified\\\">&#10003; Verified Buyer</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <p>Great value for a home practice. The blocks are firm and the strap is exactly what I needed.</p>\\n        <cite>Priya S.</cite><span class=\\\"verified\\\">&#10003; Verified Buyer</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<!-- Payment &amp; security badges -->\\n<div class=\\\"payments HDLmClass81C00361\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap row\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"seal\\\">&#128274; SSL Secured Checkout</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"seal\\\">&#10003; Verified Merchant Since 1999</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"seal\\\">&#8634; 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"paybox\\\">VISA</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"paybox\\\">MASTERCARD</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"paybox\\\">AMEX</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"paybox\\\">DISCOVER</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"paybox\\\">PAYPAL</span>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"newsletter\\\">\\n  <