\"addbtn\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"signup HDLmClassC4728413\\\" id=\\\"email-signup\\\">\\n    <h2>Take 10% off your first order</h2>\\n    <p>Join 50,000+ yogis on our email list. We&rsquo;ll send your 10% off code right away, plus early access to sales, new gear, and studio-only deals.</p>\\n    <form action=\\\"/email-signup\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <label for=\\\"signup-email\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"signup-email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send My 10% Off Code</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <ul class=\\\"perks\\\">\\n      <li>&#10003; Instant discount code</li>\\n      <li>&#10003; Exclusive subscriber sales</li>\\n      <li>&#10003; No spam &mdash; unsubscribe anytime</li>\\n    </ul>\\n    <p class=\\\"fine\\\">One-time use code for new subscribers. Valid on orders of $25 or more.</p>\\n  </section>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap fgrid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <ul><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a></li>