iers in the U.S.</li>\\n    <li>Wholesale pricing for studios &amp; events</li>\\n    <li>Real people, real support</li>\\n  </ul>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"section\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n  <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Our most popular gear for studios, events and personal practice.</p>\\n  <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/premium-yoga-mat.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Premium 1/4 inch yoga mat\\\">\\n      <h3>Premium 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; (412)</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$24.95 <span class=\\\"old\\\">$29.95</span></div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats/premium\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/foam-yoga-block.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"High density foam yoga block\\\">\\n      <h3>High-Density Foam Yoga Block</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; (287)</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks/foam\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/cotton-yoga-strap.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"8 foot cotton yoga strap with D-ring\\\">\\n      <h3>8&#39; Cotton Yoga Strap, D-Ring</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; (163)</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-straps/cotton\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/rectangular-bolster.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Rectangular cotton yoga bolster\\\">\\n      <h3>Rectangular Cotton Bolster</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; (98)</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$39.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/bolsters/rectangular\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n  