sters &amp; Cushions</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/blankets\\\">Blankets</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/studio-kits\\\">Studio Kits</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n</header>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"hero HDLmClass75BF20F2\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap hero-in\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Manufacturer-direct since 1999</div>\\n      <h1>Yoga mats &amp; props built for daily practice — at direct-from-the-source prices</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"sub\\\">We make and source our own gear, so studios, events and home practitioners get pro-grade quality without the markup. Over 500,000 orders shipped.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Best-Selling Mats</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"/studio-kits\\\">Get Studio Bulk Pricing</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"micro\\\">✔ Free shipping over $99 &nbsp; ✔ 30-day easy returns &nbsp; ✔ Ships in 1 business day</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n      <h3>New here? Take 10% off</h3>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Use code <strong>WELCOME10</strong> at checkout</li>\\n        <li>Applies to mats, blocks, bolsters &amp; kits</li>\\n        <li>Stacks with volume discounts on 10+ items</li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:14px 0 0\\\"><a class=\\\"btn alt\\\" href=\\\"/sale\\\">Shop Deals Now</a></p>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"badges HDLmClassAE1FC272\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <ul>\\n      <li><b>25+ Years</b>Serving the yoga community</li>\\n      <li><b>Free Shipping $99+</b>Fast US fulfillment</li>\\n      <li><b>30-Day Returns</b>No-hassle guarantee</li>\\n      <li><b>4.8/5 Rating</b>From 12,000+ reviews</li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>Shop by category</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Everything you need for a studio, a retreat