8719;</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-body\\\">\\n          <h3>Bolsters &amp; Cushions</h3>\\n          <p>Restorative support for gentle and prenatal classes.</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"cat-cta\\\">Shop bolsters</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </a>\\n\\n      <a class=\\\"cat-tile HDLmClass7744dd24\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blankets/\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-thumb\\\">&#129525;</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-body\\\">\\n          <h3>Blankets &amp; Towels</h3>\\n          <p>Mexican-style blankets and non-slip mat towels.</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"cat-cta\\\">Shop blankets</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </a>\\n\\n      <a class=\\\"cat-tile HDLmClass7744dd24\\\" href=\\\"/meditation/\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-thumb\\\">&#129685;</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-body\\\">\\n          <h3>Meditation</h3>\\n          <p>Zafus, zabutons, cushions, mala beads and chimes.</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"cat-cta\\\">Shop meditation</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </a>\\n\\n      <a class=\\\"cat-tile HDLmClass7744dd24\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-kits/\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"cat-flag\\\">Save 20%</span>\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-thumb\\\">&#127873;</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-body\\\">\\n          <h3>Kits &amp; Sets</h3>\\n          <p>Everything a beginner needs, bundled and discounted.</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"cat-cta\\\">Shop kits</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </a>\\n\\n      <a class=\\\"cat-tile HDLmClass7744dd24\\\" href=\\\"/sale/\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-thumb\\\">&#127991;</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"cat-body\\\">\\n          <h3>Clearance &amp; Sale</h3>\\n          <p>Overstock props and closeouts while supplies last.</p>\\n          <span class=\\\"cat-cta\\\">Shop sale</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </a>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"cat-wide HDLmClass75407f16\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h3>Studio, School &amp; Bulk Orders</h3>\\n          <p>Outfitting a studio, event or gym? Get volume pricing