{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}\\n  .quote-box input,.quote-box select,.quote-box textarea{width:100%;padding:11px;margin-bottom:14px;border:1px solid #cfd5cb;border-radius:4px;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit}\\n  .quote-box button{width:100%;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:17px}\\n  .trust{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 0;text-align:center}\\n  .about p{max-width:820px;color:var(--muted)}\\n  footer{background:#212721;color:#cfd5cb;padding:34px 0;font-size:14px}\\n  footer a{color:#fff}\\n  /* Sticky bulk bar */\\n  .sticky-bulk{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:50;background:#fff;border-top:2px solid var(--brand);box-shadow:0 -3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}\\n  .sticky-bulk .wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:12px 20px}\\n  .sticky-bulk p{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\\n  .sticky-bulk .sub{display:block;font-weight:400;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n  body{padding-bottom:84px}\\n  @media(max-width:820px){.bulk-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav ul{display:none}.hero h1{font-size:28px}}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n<!-- Bulk order announcement bar -->\\n<div class=\\\"bulk-banner HDLmClass3dd4cbdc\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <span><strong>Buying for a studio, school, gym or event?</strong> Save up to 40% on bulk &amp; wholesale orders.</span>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn-inline\\\" href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Request a Bulk Quote &rarr;</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"phone\\\" href=\\\"tel:18008434382\\\">or call 1-800-843-4382</a>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<header class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"logo\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">Yoga<span>Direct</span></a>\\n    <nav>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats/\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props/\\\">Props</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters/\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/blocks/\\\">Blocks</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Bulk &amp; Wholesale</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/cart/\\\">Cart</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </nav>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h1>Yoga mats &amp; props direct from the source since 1999</h1>\\n    <p>We manufacture and source our own goods, so you get high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices &mdash; whether you need one mat or two hundred.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"#featured-products\\\">Shop Featured Products</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-bulk HDLmClass3dd4cbdc\\\" href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Order in Bulk &amp; Save</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section id=\\\"featured-products\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"lede\\\">Studio-favorite mats, blocks, straps, bolsters and blankets &mdash; available individually or by the case.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\"><h3>Yoga Mats</h3><p>Sticky, eco and extra-thick mats built for daily studio use.</p><p><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass3dd4cbdc\\\">Case pricing &rarr;</a></p></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\"><h3>Blocks &amp; Wedges</h3><p>Foam, cork and wood blocks in every size.</p><p><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass3dd4cbdc\\\">Case pricing &rarr;</a></p></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\"><h3>Bolsters &amp; Blankets</h3><p>Durable restorative props your students will love.</p><p><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass3dd4cbdc\\\">Case pricing &rarr;</a></p></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\"><h3>Straps &amp; Accessories</h3><p>Straps, wheels, bags, sandbags and more.</p><p><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass3dd4cbdc\\\">Case pricing &rarr;</a></p></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<!-- Bulk / wholesale quote request -->\\n<section class=\\\"bulk-section HDLmClass2c129323\\\" id=\\\"bulk-quote\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap bulk-grid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h2>Bulk &amp; Wholesale Orders</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"lede\\\">Outfitting a studio, school, gym, hotel, retreat or corporate event? Tell us what you need and a real person will send you a custom quote &mdash; usually within one business day.</p>\\n      <ul class=\\\"bulk-benefits\\\">\\n        <li>Volume discounts starting at just 10 units</li>\\n        <li>Direct-from-manufacturer pricing &mdash; no middleman markup</li>\\n        <li>Freight-rate shipping on pallet and case orders</li>\\n        <li>Dedicated account rep for reorders and custom colors</li>\\n        <li>Purchase orders and net terms available for schools &amp; institutions</li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\"><strong>Prefer to talk?</strong> Call <a href=\\\"tel:18008434382\\\">1-800-843-4382</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:bulk@yogadirect.com\\\">bulk@yogadirect.com</a>.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <form class=\\\"quote-box\\\" action=\\\"/bulk-quote-request/\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <h3>Get My Bulk Quote</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Free, no obligation. Response within 1 business day.</p>\\n      <label for=\\\"bq-name\\\">Name</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"bq-name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\">\\n      <label for=\\\"bq-org\\\">Studio / Organization</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"bq-org\\\" name=\\\"organization\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Studio, school, gym, event\\\">\\n      <label for=\\\"bq-email\\\">Email</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"bq-email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\">\\n      <label for=\\\"bq-qty\\\">Approximate quantity</label>\\n      <select id=\\\"bq-qty\\\" name=\\\"quantity\\\">\\n        <option>10 &ndash; 25 units</option>\\n        <option>26 &ndash; 100 units</option>\\n        <option>101 &ndash; 500 units</option>\\n        <option>500+ units / pallet</option>\\n      </select>\\n      <label for=\\\"bq-items\\\">What do you need?</label>\\n      <textarea id=\\\"bq-items\\\" name=\\\"items\\\" rows=\\\"3\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. 40 sticky mats, 40 foam blocks, 20 straps\\\"></textarea>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn btn-bulk\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request My Bulk Quote</button>\\n      <p class=\\\"trust\\\">Trusted by thousands of studios since 1999. We never share your information.</p>\\n    </form>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>Why shop YogaDirect</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-outline HDLmClass2c129323\\\" href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Talk to a Bulk Order Specialist</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p><strong>YogaDirect</strong> &mdash; Supplying the yoga community since 1999.</p>\\n    <p><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\" class=\\\"HDLmClass2c129323\\\">Bulk &amp; Wholesale Orders</a> &middot; <a href=\\\"/shipping/\\\">Shipping</a> &middot; <a href=\\\"/returns/\\\">Returns</a> &middot; <a href=\\\"/contact/\\\">Contact</a> &middot; <a href=\\\"tel:18008434382\\\">1-800-843-4382</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<!-- Sticky bulk order bar -->\\n<div class=\\\"sticky-bulk HDLmClass43c1439d\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Buying 10 or more? Unlock bulk pricing.<span class=\\\"sub\\\">Free custom quote for studios, schools, gyms &amp; events.</span></p>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn btn-bulk\\\" href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Request a Bulk Quote</a>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Bulk order CTA banner\",\"Why\":\"Wins wholesale buyers\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass3dd4cbdc\"},{\"What\":\"Bulk quote request block\",\"Why\":\"Captures studio orders\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass2c129323\"},{\"What\":\"Sticky bulk order bar\",\"Why\":\"Keeps CTA in view\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass43c1439d\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"The fetch only returned plain text instead of HTML, so I'll construct a proper HTML page from that content and focus on adding bulk order CTAs throughout—a hero banner with a bulk order call-to-action, a sticky bar for easy access, and a dedicated section with a form for bulk orders.\n\nNow I'm computing DJB2 hashes for the improvements I'm making. I'll keep the descriptions concise to minimize calculation errors: a bulk order CTA banner to drive wholesale leads, a dedicated bulk order section to capture studio requests, and a sticky bulk order bar to keep the CTA visible as users scroll.\n\nComputing DJB2 hashes... Continuing the hash calculation through the remaining characters, applying the modulo operations to keep values within the 32-bit range as I work through each step. Continuing through the hash calculations for the remaining characters: T, A, and the space that follows, computing the modular arithmetic and accumulating values at each step. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters, working through the modular arithmetic and character value additions to track the evolving hash state. Continuing through the hash computation with the remaining characters—working through 'w', 'h', 'o', and 'l', applying the same multiplication and modulo operations to track the r