"submit\\\">Send My 10% Code</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <small>No spam &mdash; unsubscribe anytime. Coupon arrives instantly.</small>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>What Our Customers Say</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Real feedback from teachers, studios and home practitioners.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"reviews\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\\"Ordered 20 mats for my studio and the quality and price beat every other supplier I checked.\\\"<br><strong>&mdash; Dana R., Studio Owner</strong></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\\"Shipped the next day and the blocks are firm and true to size. My go-to for props now.\\\"<br><strong>&mdash; Marcus L., Yoga Teacher</strong></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\\"Great mat for the price and returns were simple when I wanted a thicker one.\\\"<br><strong>&mdash; Priya S., Home Practitioner</strong></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>Why Shop YogaDirect</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <p style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Start Shopping</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap faq\\\">\\n    <h2>Questions Before You Buy?</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Quick answers to what shoppers ask most.</p>\\n    <details><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>In-stock orders placed before 2pm ET ship the same or next business day from our warehouse.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>Do you offer bulk or studio discounts?</summary><p>Yes. Volume pricing starts at 10 units. Request a free quote and we'll respond the same business day.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>Unused items can be returned within 30 days for a refund or exchange.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>Which mat thickness should I choose?</summary><p>1/8\\\" for travel and stability, 1/4\\\" for everyday comfort, and 1/2\\\" for extra joint support and therapeutic classes.</p></details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fgrid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li></ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Customer Service</h4>\\n        <ul><li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/track\\\">Track My Order</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li></ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Business</h4>\\n        <ul><li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/studio-packages\\\">Studio Packages</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/events\\\">Event Supply</a></li></ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Talk To Us</h4>\\n        <ul><li><a href=\\\"tel:18005551234\\\">1-800-555-1234</a></li><li><a href=\\\"mailt