n      <label for=\\\"em\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"em\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send My 10% Code</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"color:#b9cbc7;margin-top:12px\\\">Join 85,000+ yogis. No spam, ever.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" style=\\\"max-width:820px\\\">\\n    <h2>Shipping, Returns &amp; Ordering</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Quick answers so you can order with confidence.</p>\\n    <details open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>Most in-stock orders leave our warehouse within 1 business day, with delivery typically in 2&ndash;6 business days depending on your location.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>When is shipping free?</summary><p>Standard shipping is free on U.S. orders over $75. Oversized and bulk orders receive a discounted freight quote at checkout.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>Unused items can be returned within 30 days for a refund or exchange. Contact our team and we will walk you through it.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>Do you offer studio or wholesale pricing?</summary><p>Yes. Volume discounts start at 6 units and we quote larger studio, school and event orders within one business day.</p></details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>About YogaDirect</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <p style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"#featured\\\">Shop Best Sellers</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap f-grid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats/\\\">Yoga Mats</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks/\\\">Yoga Blocks</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-straps/\\\">Yoga Straps</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/bolsters/\\\">Bolsters</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/sale/\\\">Sale</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Help</h4>\\n      <a href=\\\"/shipping/\\\">Shipping Info</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/returns/\\\">Returns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/contact/\\\">Contact Us</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/faq/\\\">FAQ</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Business</h4>\\n      <a href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\">Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/custom-printing/\\\">Custom Logo Printing</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/about/\\\">About Us</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Talk to a real person</h4>\\n      <a href=\\\"tel:18005551234\\\">1-800-555-1234</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"mailto:help@yogadirect.com\\\">help@yogadirect.com</a>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"color:#9aa8a6\\\">Mon&ndash;Fri, 9am&ndash;5pm ET<br>Serving the yoga community since 1999.</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"sticky HDLmClass43b8c0f\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"#featured\\\">Shop Best Sellers &mdash; Free Shipping Over $75</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added hero with clear CTA\",\"Why\":\"Speeds path to purchase\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass43b8c0f\"},{\"What\":\"Free shipping threshold bar\",\"Why\":\"Increases average order value\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass2694cd3c\"},{\"What\":\"Tr