ur practice at home.</p>\\n      <p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Best Sellers</a>\\n         <a class=\\\"btn btn-outline HDLmClass43bbb348\\\" href=\\\"#email-signup\\\">Get 10% Off Your First Order</a></p>\\n      <ul class=\\\"trust\\\">\\n        <li>Trusted since 1999</li>\\n        <li>Free shipping $75+</li>\\n        <li>Bulk &amp; studio pricing</li>\\n        <li>Easy 30-day returns</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"ph\\\" style=\\\"height:300px\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Yoga mats and props\\\"></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sect\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sect-sub\\\">Our most-loved mats and props, chosen by studios and home practitioners alike.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Deluxe yoga mat\\\"></div>\\n        <h3>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <span style=\\\"color:#5d6570\\\">(412)</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">$24.95 <span class=\\\"was\\\">$32.95</span></div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats/deluxe\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Foam yoga block\\\"></div>\\n        <h3>Foam Yoga Block</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <span style=\\\"color:#5d6570\\\">(268)</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks/foam\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Cotton yoga strap\\\"></div>\\n        <h3>8' Cotton Yoga Strap</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; <span style=\\\"color:#5d6570\\\">(151)</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">$9.95</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-straps/cotton\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Rectangular bolster\\\"></div>\\n        <h3>Rectangular Bolster</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <span style=\\\"color:#5d6570\\\">(97)</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">$39.95</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/bolsters/rectangular\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"signup HDLmClasseb3a4c07\\\" id=\\\"email-signup\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap signup-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"big\\\">10% OFF</span>\\n    <h2>Join the YogaDirect email list</h2>\\n    <p>Enter your email and we&rsquo;ll send your 10% off code instantly &mdash; plus early access to sales, new gear, and studio/bulk pricing offers.</p>\\n    <form id=\\\"signupForm\\\" novalidate>\\n      <label for=\\\"signupEmail\\\" class=\\\"visually-hidden\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n      <input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"signupEmail\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" autocomplete=\\\"email\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send My 10% Off Code</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <div class=\\\"signup-ok\\\" id=\\\"signupOk\\\">Thanks! Check your inbox &mdash; your 10% off code is on its way.</div>\\n    <p class=\\\"fineprint\\\">One code per new subscriber. No spam &mdash; unsubscribe anytime.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap about-inner\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sect\\\">Supplying the yoga community since 1999</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Shop Studio &amp; Bulk Packs</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"foot-grid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Help</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Company</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About YogaDirect</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/privacy\\\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"HDLmClasseb3a4c07\\\">\\n        <h4>Save 10% today</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Join our email list for a 10% off code and members-only deals.</p>\\n        <form id=\\\"footerSignupForm\\\" novalidate>\\n          <label for=\\\"footerEmail\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n          <input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"footerEmail\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" autocomplete=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #e6e6e3;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:8px\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;padding:11px 0;font-size:15px\\\">Get 10% Off</button>\\n        </form>\\n        <div class=\\\"signup-ok\\\" id=\\\"footerSignupOk\\\" style=\\\"background:#f1f6f1\\\">Thanks! Your 10% off code is on its way.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <p style=\\\"margin-top:28px\\\">&copy; 1999&ndash;2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"modal-back HDLmClassbd6c4565\\\" id=\\\"welcomeModal\\\" role=\\\"dialog\\\" aria-modal=\\\"true\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"welcomeModalTitle\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"modal\\\">\\n    <button class=\\\"modal-close\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" aria-label=\\\"Close\\\" data-close>&times;</button>\\n    <span class=\\\"big\\\">10% OFF</span>\\n    <h3 id=\\\"welcomeModalTitle\\\">Welcome to YogaDirect</h3>\\n    <p>Enter your email for an instant 10% off code on your first order &mdash; plus first look at new gear and sales.</p>\\n    <form id=\\\"modalSignupForm\\\" novalidate>\\n      <label for=\\\"modalEmail\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n      <input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"modalEmail\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" autocomplete=\\\"email\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Email My 10% Off Code</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <div class=\\\"signup-ok\\\" id=\\\"modalSignupOk\\\" style=\\\"background:#f1f6f1\\\">Thanks! Check your inbox for your 10% off code.</div>\\n    <button class=\\\"no-thanks\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" data-close>No thanks, I&rsquo;ll pay full price</button>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<script>\\n(function(){\\n  function handle(formId, okId){\\n    var f=document.getElementById(formId); if(!f) return;\\n    f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var input=f.querySelector('input[type=email]');\\n      if(!input.value || input.value.indexOf('@')<1){ input.focus(); return; }\\n      f.style.display='none';\\n      var ok=document.getElementById(okId); if(ok) ok.style.display='block';\\n      try{ localStorage.setItem('yd_signup','1'); }catch(err){}\\n    });\\n  }\\n  handle('signupForm','signupOk');\\n  handle('footerSignupForm','footerSignupOk');\\n  handle('modalSignupForm','modalSignupOk');\\n\\n  var modal=document.getElementById('welcomeModal');\\n  function closeModal(){ modal.classList.remove('show'); try{ localStorage.setItem('yd_modal_seen','1'); }catch(err){} }\\n  function openModal(){\\n    var seen=false, joined=false;\\n    try{ seen=localStorage.getItem('yd_modal_seen')==='1'; joined=localStorage.getItem('yd_signup')==='1'; }catch(err){}\\n    if(seen||joined) return;\\n    modal.classList.add('show');\\n    var i=document.getElementById('modalEmail'); if(i) i.focus();\\n  }\\n  Array.prototype.forEach.call(modal.querySelectorAll('[data-close]'),function(b){ b.addEventListener('click',closeModal); });\\n  modal.addEventListener('click',function(e){ if(e.target===modal) closeModal(); });\\n  document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape' && modal.classList.contains('show')) closeModal(); });\\n  setTimeout(openModal, 12000);\\n  document.addEventListener('mouseout',function(e){ if(!e.relatedTarget && e.clientY<10) openModal(); });\\n})();\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm going to retrieve the page now.I need to reconstruct the HTML page from the fetched text content and integrate an email signup section with a discount offer as the main enhancement. I'm also starting to work through some hash computation logic.\n\nI'm planning three key improvements: a hero banner announcement promoting email signup with 10% off, an inline email capture form with the disco